  'pages.dashboard.tip1': 'Configure material source and default route/supplier in ວັດສະດຸ Management for smoother demand calculation and ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ generation.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip2': 'After demand calculation, you can generate ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດs and ໃບສັ່ງຊື້s in one click; run material source verification first.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip3': 'Report production in Production Execution > Reporting; barcode and batch reporting are supported.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip4': 'Notifications cover material changes and approvals; check the bell icon in the top-right.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip5': 'Use the date range on the dashboard to view ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ and output stats for different periods (today, last 7 days, last 30 days).',
  'pages.dashboard.tip6': 'You can drag to reorder quick actions on the left for easier access.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip7': 'After a ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ is approved, create demands in Demand Management, run demand calculation, then generate work and ໃບສັ່ງຊື້s.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip8': 'Complete route and BOM setup for more accurate ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ scheduling and material calculation.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip9': 'Configure custom fields under System > Custom Fields to extend form fields across documents.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip10': 'Maintain unit conversion in ວັດສະດຸ Management; orders and inventory will convert automatically.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip11': 'ວັດສະດຸ changes trigger downstream notifications; check Message Notifications for impact and suggested actions.',
  'pages.dashboard.tip12': 'Demand calculation chooses mode by source (forecast vs order); the system suggests the type when creating.',
